# TuyaOpen build configuration for silent_powmr.
#
# Generate this for your ESP32 variant ONCE, inside firmware/, with:
#
#     tos.py config choice      # then select esp32 / esp32c3 / esp32s3
#
# and commit the resulting app_default.config so CI (and repeat builds) work
# non-interactively.
#
# This placeholder exists because the TuyaOpen toolchain was not available in the
# environment where the project was generated, so the concrete Kconfig values
# could not be produced here.
